                <mxCell id="ItVktoH8c3pSvErCQbVa-0" value="Scenario-2&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Check for &quot;icmp&quot; connectivity from VM-C to VM-A and VM-B&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Show your fault finding steps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Explain your methods&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=21;" vertex="1" parent="pRChyknurL-5CSyDld1t-1">
                    <mxGeometry x="300" y="10" width="621" height="174" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="3hgwdSIq_gh6bETAlBOa-0" value="&lt;p lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;HPING3&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt;&quot;&gt;sudo apt update &amp;amp;&amp;amp; sudo apt install -y iperf3 hping3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;# Install Traceroute&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;sudo apt update&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;sudo apt install inetutils-traceroute&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;APACHE install&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;sudo apt-get update -y&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;sudo apt-get install apache2 -y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-size: 11pt;&quot; lang=&quot;en-ZA&quot;&gt;sudo apt-get upgrade -y&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;" vertex="1" parent="pRChyknurL-5CSyDld1t-1">
                    <mxGeometry x="921" y="190" width="520" height="310" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="3hgwdSIq_gh6bETAlBOa-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Using TCPDUMP&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to see who is Pinging the host&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;sudo tcpdump -ni eth0 icmp&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to see only traffic from 1 IP  who is Pinging the host&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;sudo tcpdump -ni eth0 icmp and host 172.21.1.33&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to see only traffic from 1 IP range who is Pinging the host&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;sudo tcpdump -ni eth0 icmp and host 172.21.1.4&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to see only traffic from 1 IP range who is Pinging the host&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;sudo tcpdump -ni eth0 icmp and net 192.168.4.0/24 -c 10&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to see only traffic from ANY IP on port 22&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;sudo tcpdump -i any src port 22&lt;br&gt; tcpdump -ni eth0 port 22 and net 192.168.1.0/24&lt;br&gt; tcpdump -ni eth0 port 22 and host 192.168.1.4" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;" vertex="1" parent="pRChyknurL-5CSyDld1t-1">
                    <mxGeometry x="140" y="590" width="560" height="250" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Install hping3&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sudo apt install -y hping3&lt;br&gt;When installation is finished, we can check hping3 version:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;hping3 --version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Testing hping3&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Now we can test. Let&#39;s say we want to check whether port 443 is open and calculate the round-trip time (RTT). Run the following command to do that:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To do a normal ICMP Ping&lt;br&gt;sudo hping3 -1 8.8.8.8&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To ping to a IP addi and specific Port&lt;br&gt;sudo hping3 -S -p 22 za-east.fortiddns.com&lt;br&gt;sudo hping3 --icmp -c 10 bing.com&lt;br&gt;sudo hping3 -S -p 22 --beep za-east.fortiddns.com&lt;br&gt;sudo hping3 --icmp -c 10 --beep -i 2 www.bing.com&lt;/div&gt;" link="Install hping3&#xa;&#xa;sudo apt install -y hping3&#xa;When installation is finished, we can check hping3 version:&#xa;&#xa;1&#xa;hping3 --version&#xa;Testing hping3&#xa;Now we can test. Let&#39;s say we want to check whether port 443 is open and calculate the round-trip time (RTT). Run the following command to do that:&#xa;&#xa;Examples&#xa;&#xa;To do a normal ICMP Ping&#xa;sudo hping3 -1 8.8.8.8&#xa;&#xa;To ping to a IP addi and specific Port&#xa;sudo hping3 -S -p 22 za-east.fortiddns.com&#xa;sudo hping3 --icmp -c 10 bing.com&#xa;sudo hping3 -S -p 22 --beep za-east.fortiddns.com&#xa;sudo hping3 --icmp -c 10 --beep -i 2 www.bing.com" id="uIjJr0aK-Jg2oA6yqc-i-0">
                    <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;" vertex="1" parent="pRChyknurL-5CSyDld1t-1">
                        <mxGeometry x="620" y="600" width="560" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
                <mxCell id="NRZHKk1XrF3Goxw14DtS-0" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" vertex="1" parent="pRChyknurL-5CSyDld1t-1">
                    <mxGeometry x="140" y="200" width="747" height="320" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
